4 Phase 7's entry conditions\n1274:### 8.5 Ordering and concurrency\n1290:## 9. Verification honesty\n1327:## 10. Findings and proposed amendments\n1335:### 10.1 To the frozen design (`yin.vm.semantic-register-vm.md`)\n1380:### 10.2 To UCF (`yin.vm.universal-continuation-format.md`)\n1466:### 10.3 To the row-carrier draft (`yin.vm.ucf-transport-tuples.md`)\n1629:### 10.4 To code-as-tuples (`yin.vm.code-as-tuples.md`) §7.2\n1644:### 10.5 Checked and consistent (no amendment)\n1654:## 11. Owner questions\n1662:## 12. Portability notes for the implementer\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
